  "description": {
    "raw": "A creature targeted by this spell is held immobile by glowing\ngolden chains composed of pure light. The creature is paralyzed\nand held in place, but may attempt a new saving throw each round\nto end the effect. While held by the golden chains, a creature\ncannot use any sort of extradimensional travel, such as astral\nprojection, blink, dimension door, ethereal jaunt, etherealness,\ngate, maze, plane shift, shadow walk, teleport, and similar spells\nand spell-like abilities. The spell does not affect creatures that are\nalready in ethereal or astral form when the spell is cast.",
    "search_text": "\"a creature targeted by this spell is held immobile by glowing\\ngolden chains composed of pure light. the creature is paralyzed\\nand held in place, but may attempt a new saving throw each round\\nto end the effect. while held by the golden chains, a creature\\ncannot use any sort of extradimensional travel, such as astral\\nprojection, blink, dimension door, ethereal jaunt, etherealness,\\ngate, maze, plane shift, shadow walk, teleport, and similar spells\\nand spell-like abilities. the spell does not affect creatures that are\\nalready in ethereal or astral form when the spell is cast.\"",
